><surname>Hickenbotham</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Magrini</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Eldred</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Viral discovery and sequence recovery using DNA microarrays.</article-title><source>PLoS Biol</source><year>2003</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>E2</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14624234</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1371/journal.pbio.0000002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Perrin</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Duracher</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Perret</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Cleuziat</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Mandrand</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A combined oligonucleotide and protein microarray for the codetection of nucleic acids and antibodies associated with human immunodeficiency virus, hepatitis B virus, and hepatitis C virus infections.</article-title><source>Anal Biochem</source><year>2003</year><volume>322</volume><fpage>148</fpage><lpage>155</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14596821</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ab.2003.08.002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sergeev</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Distler</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Courtney</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Al-Khaldi</surname><given-names>SF</given-names></name><name><surname>Volokhov</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Chizhikov</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Rasooly</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article